'''Zarra''' was the [[capital]] [[city]] of the [[planet]] [[Cato Neimoidia]].<ref name="Brotherhood" /> During the [[Imperial Era]], [[Bandit Billie]] stole the contents of [[Tobias Beckett]]'s pack, including the ''[[Smuggler's Guide]]'', from him in Zarra.<ref name="Smuggler's Guide" />

